- cpufreq: intel_pstate: Support Emerald Rapids OOB mode (Srinivas Pandruvada)
- anolis: vfio-pci: expose the vfio_device->open_count to user. (Qinyun Tan)
- x86/fpu: Prevent FPU state corruption (Thomas Gleixner)

